      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1916, a street was renamed after Marshal Joseph Joffre, with the new name unveiled by him in 1922.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shanghai_French_Concession",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Wukang Mansion, a historic building, remains a favorite spot for photographers and history lovers in the Concession.",
